@startuml
title MS1 · Challenges — Modèle de classes (S4)

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam ClassBackgroundColor #F7F9FC
skinparam ClassBorderColor #2E5A88
skinparam ArrowColor #2E5A88
skinparam FontName Helvetica
skinparam FontSize 12
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8E1
skinparam NoteBorderColor #D9A400

enum ChallengeStatus <<enumeration>> {
  DRAFT
  PUBLISHED
  IN_PROGRESS
  JUDGING
  CLOSED
  CANCELLED
}

class Enterprise <<external>> {
  +id: UUID
  +displayName: String
  +keycloakId: String
}

class Challenge <<aggregate>> {
  +id: UUID
  +title: String
  +description: String
  +enterpriseId: UUID
  +deadline: LocalDateTime
  +tags: List~String~
  +status: ChallengeStatus
  +createdAt: LocalDateTime
  +publishedAt: LocalDateTime
  --
  +create(ChallengeCreate data): Challenge {static}
  +publish(): Challenge
  +update(ChallengeCreate data): Challenge
  +cancel(String reason): Challenge
  +isOpen(): boolean
  +acceptsApplications(): boolean
  +addCriterion(AcceptanceCriterion c): void
  +setPrizes(List~Prize~ prizes): void
}

class ChallengeCreate <<DTO>> {
  +title: String
  +description: String
  +enterpriseId: UUID
  +deadline: LocalDateTime
  +tags: List~String~
}

class AcceptanceCriterion <<entity>> {
  +id: String
  +description: String
  +weight: double
  +testCommand: String
  --
  +hasTestCommand(): boolean
  +validateWeight(): boolean
}

class Prize <<value object>> {
  +rank: int
  +amount: BigDecimal
  +currency: String
  --
  +isTopThree(): boolean
  +formattedAmount(): String
}

Enterprise "1" --> "0..*" Challenge : publie (enterpriseId)
ChallengeCreate ..> Challenge : mapping à la création
Challenge "1" *-- "1..*" AcceptanceCriterion : contient
Challenge "1" *-- "3" Prize : top 3
Challenge --> ChallengeStatus : status

note right of Challenge
  Agrégat racine de MS1 (base H2 dédiée).
  Règles :
  • title ≤ 140 caractères ;
  • publishedAt non nul dès PUBLISHED ;
  • update() refusé hors DRAFT ;
  • enterpriseId = référence par UUID,
    aucune clé étrangère inter-services.
end note

note bottom of AcceptanceCriterion
  weight ∈ [0,1].
  testCommand (optionnel) est exécuté
  par MS5 dans le bac à sable.
end note

legend bottom left
  <<external>> : entité possédée par un autre service, référencée par son identifiant.
  <<DTO>> : objet de transport, non persisté.
end legend
@enduml
